WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,460
young man

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:05,060
You are such a good person

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,460
Since you need clothes

4
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,860
I've cleaned up some clothes for you here.

5
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,060
Take it with you, grandma

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,460
Thank you very much

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,460
What nonsense are you kidding?

8
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,460
I should be thanking you

9
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,860
If you weren't here

10
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:20,660
There's enough garbage for me to move today

11
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:23,240
Good man

12
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,440
this era

13
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,640
Such a good person

14
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,840
Not much left, Brother Xiao

15
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,240
What do you want clothes for?

16
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:33,620
My clothes are of great use, so just leave them alone, okay.

17
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,620
You go back first

18
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:37,020
If you don’t come back to live with me, you won’t come back.

19
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,220
I have something else to do tonight

20
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,220
Just go back first

21
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,020
I'll come see you tomorrow

22
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,620
Then let's meet at the labor market tomorrow

23
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:48,070
With these clothes

24
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:58,620
This will allow more people to wear their clothes in winter.

25
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,620
Let me show you

26
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,420
These are the clothes I got back from over there
